        "definition": "flowchart TD\n    Client[Client] --> WAF[Web Application Firewall]\n    WAF --> Gateway[API Gateway]\n    Gateway --> Auth[Authentication]\n    Auth --> Svc[Service]\n    Svc --> Authz[Authorization]\n    Authz --> DB[(Encrypted DB)]\n    Note[Each layer adds security]"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
